y chore: a Wells Fargo download [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]link, one import command, then Ctrl+Enter on each waiting bank row [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]opens a Category card where a single key ticks the row, files its [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]category from Bryan's own list, and lands the cursor on the next [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]waiting row, so a week of transactions takes about two minutes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]8[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bank_weekly_category_walk.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/bank_weekly_category_walk.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-lc[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-lc/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]One weekly Bank chore with the Wells Fargo link[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]weekly-chore[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]weekly-chore: in the vault, turn the Monday Bank import chore into the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]single weekly Bank chore (verified Wells Fargo download link, #browser, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]one-line import command, the walk), and cancel the daily Acknowledge [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bank occurrence with history intact.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Clean Wells Fargo QFX payees and merchant keys[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]qfx-cleaning[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]qfx-cleaning: teach naming.rs the real QFX description shapes so payees [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lose dates, places, card digits, order codes, and the account holder's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]name; merchant keys collapse repeat merchants; learned payees are [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]re-cleaned; the default account stops getting \\[acct::].[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Category hotkeys, groups, hidden, and row suggestions[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]category-contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]after qfx-cleaning[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]category-contract: add the mapping form for bank.categories (label, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hotkey, group, hidden) with derivation and validation, report [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hotkey/group/hidden in categories[], add a read-time suggestion [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]{category, source} to every row JSON from one function shared with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]import, and point import's next step at the walk.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bryan's taxonomy in bank.md and clean seed rows[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]vault-rollout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after category-contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault-rollout: after every host runs the new bob, write the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]journal-grounded category list with hotkeys and groups into bank.md, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]drop the dead VENMO rule, re-clean the seven seed rows (and pre-file [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]them per the decision), and update the hub prose to the weekly ritual.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pure Category card, write, and advance models[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]card-model[dim] · [dim][/dim]after category-contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]card-model: in bob-ledger-tools, add pure, unit-tested models for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]decoding the new JSON, the card view model and key table, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]single-transaction row write plan, the next-waiting-row finder, the walk[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]session counter, and the end-of-run summary.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The Category card, the walk, and Bank set category[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]card-ui[dim] · [dim][/dim]after card-model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]card-ui: render the Category card in the key-card family, wire api.bank [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]v2 claimRowClose and setCategory, commit, advance, refresh suggestions [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]after each filing, show the end-of-run notice, add Bank: set category, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hide hidden categories from [cat:: suggestions, and land waiting-pill [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]jumps at the payee.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Ctrl+Enter hand-off, jump history, real-Obsidian proof, deploy[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ctrl-enter-walk[dim] · [dim][/dim]after card-ui, vault-rollout[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ctrl-enter-walk: make task-status-cycler delegate Ctrl+Enter on waiting [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bank rows to ledger-tools with today's flip as fallback, add nav's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]recordJump member for the Ctrl+O landing, extend the real-Obsidian bank [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]e2e, document the plugins, and deploy with bob plugins sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Weekly guide, contract docs, memory, and the trial[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]wrapup[dim] · [dim][/dim]after weekly-chore, ctrl-enter-walk[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]wrapup: rewrite the bank guide for the weekly walk, note the card in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/bank.md ownership